// Fused tail: global avg pool + bias add + sum(dim=1)
// Input:[N, C, D, H, W] float32
// Bias:   [C] float32 (pre-flattened)
// Output: [N, 1, 1, 1] float32
// Grid:   (N, C), each block reduces spatial=D*H*W elements for one (n,c)
